  "details": "Description\n\nChanging into a avatar that is not been cashed, consistantly brakes the mic and radial menu buttons on avatar load.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. Change into a old avatar thru the big menu or thru the looks menu. \n\n2. Wait for it to load.\n\n3. The Mic and Radial menu buttons are stuck. \n\nThis is more consistent with old avatars that have not been loaded for a long time. This also works with the looks radial menu with old looks.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1898-626e35030c-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-26_02-18-00.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_fb714fff-9a9a-4b43-8728-f4e8bda4570d/1/file)",
